    <string name="settings_community_standards_title">Melao ya setšhaba</string>
    <string name="settings_community_standards_body">StudySync ke ya go ithuta le go šoma mmogo. O se ke wa abelana, wa kgopela, goba wa nyaka ditshwantšho tša bofeela, tša thobalano, goba diteng tše dingwe tša thobalano melaetšeng, difaeleng, dikgoung tša video, goba profaeleng ya gago. Re ka tloša diteng le go emiša diakhaonte tše di robago melao ye.</string>
    <string name="classes_hero_subtitle">Beakanya dikopano, tsena live, o boloke dinoutse le didirišwa lefelong le tee.</string>
    <string name="classes_hint_has_items">Bula klase bakeng sa dintlha, video ya live, le difaele tše abelanwago. O ka e fetola go tšwa skrining sa dintlha.</string>
    <string name="classes_hint_empty">Hlama klase ka + go tsenya dikopano, dilinki, le ditokumente.</string>
    <string name="dashboard_empty_activity">Ga go na mošomo wa morago bjale. Bula sehlopha go abelana difaele le go bolela, goba thoma klase ya dikopano tša live.</string>
    <string name="chats_hero_subtitle">Romela melaetša dihlopheng tša gago o latele dikaonafatšo tše abelanwago.</string>
    <string name="groups_hero_title">Dihlopha</string>
    <string name="groups_hero_subtitle">Hlama lefelo la go bolela le go abelana ditokumente — ke moka o bule Melaetša go bolela.</string>
    <string name="groups_dialog_new_title">Sehlopha se sefsa</string>
    <string name="groups_empty_hint">Ga go na dihlopha. Tobetsa + go hlama lefelo la difaele le poledišano.</string>
